cial applications. The company serves the industrial motors, transmission and distribution, railway, aerospace, automotive, marine, defense, engineering, life science, and pharmaceutical industries. The company was formerly known as Modison Metals Limited and changed its name to Modison Limited in July 2022. Modison Limited was founded in 1965 and is based in Vapi, India."}}